<title>USA: Ipalco completes stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>Ipalco completes stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ipalco Enterprises Inc on Monday said it completed the repurchase of 12 million of its common shares for no more than $32 a share.</p>
<p>About 12.66 million shares had been tendered and not withdrawn by the deadline March 27, Ipalco said.</p>
<p>All shareholders who tendered their stock will receive the same amount for their holdings, the company said. Ipalco, a multistate energy company, said it must still determine the final number of shares to be purchased and the final purchase price.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 3/8 Monday at 30-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
